// This is MWA devices profile
// Format for each line is ACTION=KEY
// The permissible ascii value are CONTROLA to CONTROLZ and F1 to F4, 
// except the following key as it conflicts with navigation key
// CONTROLH (backspace), CONTROLI (tab), CONTROLM (enter)
//
// ACTION should be less than or equal to 19 characters for
// translation purpose. The actual text of the action is taken from
// AK prompt under attribute code "INDUSTRIAL_" + ACTION, e.g. 
// "INDUSTRIAL_MWA_HELP", etc.
// Do not delete this commented  line    %s_
// NOTE: CASE SENSITIVE
// $Header: default_key.ini 120.0 2005/07/19 05:02:30 ajohnson noship $
// Last Modified Date: 09/19/2013 Kristofer Cruz
//
