//						Remap CTL+O to MWA_BACK    (F3)
//						Remap CTL+Y to MWA_MENU    (F2)
// 1.1       Ganapathy Natarajan 17-Oct-2013 Remap the mapping for F1 key
// 1.2		Trying CTRL X
//
